            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wpisz <code>\"Meg\"</code> pod indeksem <code>0</code> i <code>\"Max\"</code> pod indeksem <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Meg\"</code>, a następnie <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
